Third-party code

This package bundles the Open Dynamics Engine (ODE) 0.16.6, as C/C++ sources
(ios/Classes, macos/Classes) and as prebuilt binaries
(android/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/libode.so, assets/ode.wasm, assets/ode.js).
ODE is Copyright (c) 2001-2007 Russell L. Smith and contributors, and is
offered under your choice of the LGPL 2.1 or a BSD-style license. This package
uses and redistributes ODE under the BSD-style license, reproduced in full in
LICENSE-ODE-BSD.txt. The LGPL text is kept in LICENSE-ODE-LGPL.txt for
reference only.
